         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### General Rules\n\nThe table of 6 unites the tables of 2 and 3: 2 × 6 = 6 × 2 and 3 × 4 = 6 × 2 — two groups of six, six groups of two and four groups of three are all the same quantity.\n\nSelect an equality on the left and then its result on the right. Match every pair to complete the level and move on to the next one!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
