         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Game\n\nMatch each equality on the left with its result on the right. The result also appears as groups of characters, so you can count them to check your answer — every rectangle holds six characters, exactly like the 6 × Z side of the equality. If a pair is wrong, a message will ask you to try again.",
